OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry into street party that
OL,4,Awoke up neighbourhood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA University of Nottingham spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid they opened an investigation at a
OL,8,Fprivate property in Lenton and were
OL,9,Fworking with the police to support
OL,10,Ftheir probe into anti-social issues in
OL,11,Fthe area.
